Third-party material
  Material not created by the SCALE contributors stays under its owners' terms. The repository holds no
  third-party text: it cites names and identifiers only.

  Names of external vocabularies and standards (OWL-Time, the Evidence & Conclusion Ontology, Gene
  Ontology causal activity models, OPTIMADE, SSSOM and others) and identifiers of their terms are cited;
  no text of them is reproduced. The exporter for the knowledge-graph bundle format (kg-bundle,
  tools/kgbundle.py) is SCALE code; no code or text of the format's specification is included.

Project data
  Curated project data that is not cleared for publication is never committed: every committed document
  states access public, and `scale check` verifies it. Such data stays with its project, under the
  project's own terms; neither licence above applies to it. See governance/licensing.md.
